            en: 'The spiral organized building around risk; the attack tree is that risk analysis scaled down to security: enumerate assets, decompose the adversary\u2019s goal into branches and leaves, then read the leaves as defenses. In the STRIDE matrix (chapter 11) the best-known category appears: elevation of privilege — answered by server-side authorization on every access.',
